# HackMyAgent scan exclusions, read by `npx hackmyagent secure .`.
# The <path>:<CHECK-ID> rules below need HackMyAgent 0.33.0 or later.
# Earlier releases read each line as a path that matches no file, so the
# rules do nothing there.
# Each rule leaves one check out for one file and says why. No whole-path
# rules and no repo-wide `!CHECK` rules; src/__tests__/hmaignore.test.ts
# enforces this.

scripts/smoke-export.mjs:NEMO-009 # Playwright page.$eval(selector, fn) queries the DOM; it is not eval()
scripts/smoke-scope.mjs:NEMO-009 # Puppeteer page.$eval(selector, fn) queries the DOM; it is not eval()
